  "id": 1677,
  "description": "# TRAINING GROUND FOR NEW PLAYERS\n\nThis guild is dedicated to helping new players progress and become familiar with guild mechanics.\n\nOnce members reach the level or requirements needed to join another guild that better suits their goals, they’re free to leave—however, everyone can stay for as long as they want.\n\nIn return, members are asked to contribute to guild challenges to earn the guild marks needed to run raids. If possible, also donate to the stockpile to help with guild maintenance.\n\n•\n\n##### Notes\n\nTimezone: UTC +1\n\nNo Discord Channel.\n\nMembers inactive for 7 days may be removed to make room for active players.\n\n•\n\n##### Raid Schedule\n\nTBA\n\nOnly 3 raids allowed in a 24 hour period.\n\n•\n\n##### Newbie Tips\n\nYou can play your main character however you like.\n\nA useful tip is to create an additional Chef character dedicated to fishing and cooking. Sell the cooked food to vendors to earn gold, then transfer the gold to your main character. You can trade between your own characters once they reach Level 150.\n\nYou can also do the same with a Smelter character dedicated to mining and smelting if you want another way to generate gold.",
